{"id":"n28807-1-8","stage":4,"title":"격렬하다 · 激烈","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28807-1-8-1","ko":"춤이 좀 격렬하지?","zh":"这个舞蹈有点激烈吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"춤이","meaning":"舞蹈","explanation":"춤：舞蹈；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"춤","audio":"/audio/0a72ac28b3e9721b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29542","senseId":"1","lemma":"춤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춤이","audio":"/audio/b35cabdb23bce49c4e75.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"격렬하지?","meaning":"激烈","explanation":"격렬하다：激烈；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"격렬하다","audio":"/audio/c40efd70bb54e20904a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28807","senseId":"1","lemma":"격렬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"격렬하지","audio":"/audio/dead9e0738f45b593e91.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0a72ac28b3e9721b","term":"춤","zh":"舞蹈","audio":"/audio/0a72ac28b3e9721b7e27.mp3","entryId":"29542","definition":"随着音乐或节奏舞动身体。","pronunciation":["춤"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"c40efd70bb54e209","term":"격렬하다","zh":"激烈","audio":"/audio/c40efd70bb54e20904a7.mp3","entryId":"28807","definition":"言语或行动等非常粗犷而猛烈。","pronunciation":["경녈하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8391efc55075c8e47ea2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28807-1-8-2","ko":"그렇네. 한 번 추고 나니 땀이 뻘뻘 날 정도야.","zh":"确实。跳完一轮后，汗都冒得哗哗流呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇네.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","l